{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/894540-unarmed-relic","id":894540,"title":"unarmed relic","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-19T20:57:40-07:00","id":894540,"title":"unarmed relic","content":"So, I am working on a Scion that uses Brawl and Melee (don't like being useless when getting disarmed), I sometimes clinch when I need to, I was looking for a good relic that works when beating face and when clinching. I went over the relic stuff, thinking it'd be easy to figure out something good but I just can't think of anything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11817-shirokiba","name":"Shirokiba","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-20T11:05:28-07:00","id":894831,"title":"","content":"A tattoo that gives you the dice bonuses of using a weapon without actually being a weapon. A very simple fix to the downsides of unarmed combat, and one I've used several times.<br /> <br /> Disarming isn't something that happens very often. Toss 1 extra dot onto any Relic Weapon to call it a body enhancement instead, go to town.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-20T21:40:37-07:00","id":895287,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Telgar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/894540-unarmed-relic?p=894831#post894831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A tattoo that gives you the dice bonuses of using a weapon without actually being a weapon. A very simple fix to the downsides of unarmed combat, and one I've used several times.<br /> <br /> Disarming isn't something that happens very often. Toss 1 extra dot onto any Relic Weapon to call it a body enhancement instead, go to town.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I like the idea of that Tattoo.<br /> <br /> Guessing I should probably buff the damage, for the most part?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11817,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11817-shirokiba","user":"Shirokiba","date":". 05-21-2016, 03:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11817-shirokiba","name":"Shirokiba","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-21T05:44:38-07:00","id":895439,"title":"","content":"For a basic Relic, I'd take something like.. a Mace or a Club as the base of the Relic. Then make any modifications as normal for your game, like boosting damage, accuracy, reducing Speed, etc. Then all you need to do is toss 1 extra dot on top to make it an unarmed attack instead of a weapon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-21T09:14:08-07:00","id":895515,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the help, that gives me some ideas to work with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11817-shirokiba","name":"Shirokiba","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-22T04:58:26-07:00","id":896020,"title":"","content":"I went with a two dot relic tattoo (made with ink from the Celestrial Bureuchracy's department of Mayhem and Destruction) and the Bodyarmor Knack for my Scion of Monky King. One Dot for turning his unarmed strikes from Bashing into Leathal Damage (Special 1 Dot Enchantment. Costs 1 dot of Willpower to activate, lasts for the rest of the scene) the second dot for giving his brawl attacks a range of (5xLegend) Yards. The passiv part of Bodyarmor Knack allows him to parry/block weapons as if he did it with a weapon of his own.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11025-ganruy","name":"Ganruy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-28T11:49:35-07:00","id":902188,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Telgar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/894540-unarmed-relic?p=894831#post894831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A tattoo that gives you the dice bonuses of using a weapon without actually being a weapon. A very simple fix to the downsides of unarmed combat, and one I've used several times.<br /> <br /> Disarming isn't something that happens very often. Toss 1 extra dot onto any Relic Weapon to call it a body enhancement instead, go to town.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also, depending on how you treat relics in your game, you could also make it possible to &quot;disarm&quot; such a tatoo. In our games, it's possible to rip away such a tatoo with the use of a stunt, thus making it &quot;disarmable&quot;: But a +1 dot to make it &quot;undisarmable&quot; is a really good idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/593-gemstone","name":"Gemstone","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T04:29:45-07:00","id":903390,"title":"","content":"A ring that adds to unarmed bashing damage?<br /> <br /> Smack them when your ring hand! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-02T21:30:33-07:00","id":906192,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/894540-unarmed-relic?p=903390#post903390\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A ring that adds to unarmed bashing damage?<br /> <br /> Smack them when your ring hand! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I read that and in doing so it translated in my head to &quot;Smack them with your pimp hand&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'll be your Huckleberry","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2397-the-dude","name":"The Dude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}